FourOne-PracticalAssignments

i do assignments here.. im student afterall.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Assignment 1 — Agentic AI (see assignment-agenticai/)

1. LLM Workflow (5 Marks): Develop a Python program that accepts user input and generates a response using an LLM (OpenAI/Gemini/Ollama).
2. Prompt Chaining (5 Marks): Implement a multi-step LLM workflow to generate a summary, extract key points, and produce three questions from a given topic.
3. Agentic AI (5 Marks): Build a simple AI agent that accepts a task, plans the required steps, executes them, and displays the final output.
4. RAG-Based Question Answering (5 Marks): Develop a basic RAG application that retrieves relevant information from a PDF/TXT document and answers user queries using an LLM.

Submission Deadline : 20-07-26, Monday.

How to run: cd assignment-agenticai && ./run.sh

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Laboratory Experiments (see experiments/)

12 case-study-driven labs covering the LLM/agentic AI stack: Text-to-SQL,
RAG QA, prompt chaining, a SQL ReAct agent, a multi-agent SDR system, a
policy compliance agent, a deep research agent, image retrieval/visual QA,
reasoning-strategy benchmarking, fine-tuning, model optimization, and a
capstone that ties it all together.

Built one lab at a time, fully working, in order (10 of 12 done so far).
See experiments/README.md for the full list, status, and how to run each one.

How to run: cd experiments && pip install -r requirements.txt && python 01_text_to_sql/main.py
